window.products.push({"id":243198,"name":"Handheld Portable Sewing Machine, 18 PCS Mini Cordless Handheld Quick Stitch Electric Household Tool for Fabric, Kite Making, Kids Cloth, Home DIY Pet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814r3klcGrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Battery powered: 4 x AA batteries (not included) Power Supply: DC 6V 600 MA (not included) Size: 8.26 * 2.56 * 1.34in Weight: Approx. 0.63 lbFeatures: ?1.Just press a button and the electric sewing machine can work automatically. Ideal for sewing and repairing fabrics and curtains ?2.Small and portable, Simple operation, flat edge line, automatic movement. ?3.Apply to all types of fabrics, You can use the machine without taking off your clothes, which is easy to sew. ?4.High intensity, low noise, not easy to slip. ?5.There are 2 power modes. It can use 4 xAA batteries or a 6V DC power adapter (both not included). ?6.Wide range of applications: Mini sewing machines can sew a variety of things, eg. Curtains, clothes, dolls etc. ?7.The fast sewing machine is made of high quality plastic and metal parts for a long life.The thickness of the fabric is about 1.8mm and should not be too thick or too thin.Packing list: 1 x Instruction Manual 1 x Long rod 1 x Threader 1 x Sewing needles 6 x Coils 10 x Safety pins 1 x Scissors 1 x tape measure Please note: Please pay attention to the order of the positive and negative battery. 1. Make sure to follow the threading procedures and instructions in the user manual, as incorrect wiring will cause the machine to fail to sew. Service: 100 Percent PURCHASE WITHOUT RISKS: If you are not satisfied with the goods Please feel free to contact us, we will serve you wholeheartedly. How To Thread??1:Insert the bobbin into the bobbin?2:Fix the position of the bobbin.?3:Pass the thread through the thread hole.?4:Pass the thread through the tension control device to control the ?5:tightness of the thread.?6:Pass the circle near the tension control.?7:Pass the thread through the needle with a threader.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814r3klcGrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UNOIF","source_asin":"B08SJGG9S6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243198","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJGG9S6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJGG9S6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
