window.products.push({"id":243205,"name":"T&I Home Diamond Design 100% Cotton Turkish Beach Towel - Mustard, Quick Dry, Prewashed, Oversized (36x70) Decorative Bathroom Towel, Turkish Peshtema","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814ZNldagDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is the Peshtemal Towel? Traditional Turkish towels orPeshtemals were woven thin patterned fabrics that is using in only Turkishbaths for body covering until a few years ago. Day by day, turkish towels weredeveloped and started to keep up with modern-day fashion. Nowadays, we started to use thiscool towels in many parts of our lives cause of it's stylish and very useful. You should not miss out on thisluxury convenience. What are our features that make us different? ✔100%Natural Cotton ✔Oeko-Tex100 Certified - Safe for you and your family ✔EcoFriendly ✔Prewashed| No Shrinkage ✔ExtraordinarySoft and Elegant ✔SpecialJacquard Designs and Decorative Bath Towels ✔EasyCare ✔HighlyAbsorbent ✔Fastand Quick Driying Multi Purpose Our Turkish Bath Towels areperfect as Beach, SPA, Yoga, Gym, Pool towels, Beach and picnic blanket, washclothes and best travel companion in your bag when you traveling. Care Instruction It'srecomended to wash before using. Machine wash COLD with milddetergent, tumble dry low heat and delicate. Please do not use bleach and fabric softener.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814ZNldagDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T&I Home","source_asin":"B08SV2CXSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SV2CXSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SV2CXSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
