window.products.push({"id":243297,"name":"Tommy Bahama Triple Protection Stain Release Waterproof Mattress Pad King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xCG2khbtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size:King Tommy Bahama luxury combined with three separate levels of protection is a dream. Stain Resistant fabric offers protection against usage, silver infused antimicrobial treated polyester blocks odor issues, and whisper quiet waterproof lamination on the bottom of the pad protects your mattress. Assembled in the USA, this machine washable mattress pad is designed to fit mattresses up to 18 inches in height. With 12 ounces per square yard it is considered a thick mattress pad (versus a typical 6-8 oz sq/yd model). We recommend washing and drying in a commercial size machine. We recommend Not using a machine with an agitator as it can cause ripping.Additional Information: Designed to fit a 7\"-18\" MattressPlease know, this is not a mattress, it is a mattress pad that goes on top of a mattressPlush & Extra Thick - 12 Oz. Per Square YardStain Resistant 400 Thread Count FabricSilver Infused Antimicrobial Polyester FillingWhisper Quiet Waterproof Protection On TopInfinity Skirt Fits Beds SnugAssembled In The USASize & Dimension Information:Twin - 39 x 75- 12 Oz. Per Sq. Yd.Twin XL - 39 x 80 - 12 Oz. Per Sq. Yd.Full/Double - 54 x 75 - 12 Oz. Per Sq. Yd.Queen - 60 x 80 - 12 Oz. Per Sq. Yd.King - 78 x 80 - 12 Oz. Per Sq. Yd.Cal King - 72 x 84 - 12 Oz. Per Sq. Yd.Please know that this product is manufactured by DOWNLITE Bedding. Only items bought from the DOWNLITE Bedding Seller are guaranteed new, unused items that are being shipped direct from the manufacture facility. If the Buy Box does not say DOWNLITE Bedding and you go through the Buy Box Seller, there is no guarantee that your item is new and unused, or that it is the same product. 100% of DOWNLITEs Pillows, Comforters & Mattress Pads are assembled in the USA (with American and imported materials). Therefore, when purchasing do not purchase from a seller located in another country.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xCG2khbtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tommy Bahama","source_asin":"B00LWAXDJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LWAXDJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LWAXDJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
