window.products.push({"id":243310,"name":"SUNNOW Vastto 16 Ounce Chromatic Glass Spray Bottle with 4 Pumps,2 Sprayers and 8 Labels,Refillable Container Pumb Bottle for Essential Oil,Aromathera","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XuFkPpp1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Features】The set of 16 ounce glass pumb bottle is crafted from durable glass in a bright tone,simple, practical and elegant.With durable plastic pump head and reliable adjustable squeeze trigger sprayer for precise, effortless output.The pump head can be locked by reverse rotation,and the nozzle can be rotated to adjust the size of the spray.BPA free and lead free.Eco-friendly, efficient, and easy to use. 【Dimensions】2.8'' D x 6.9'' H.Easy to refill as the storage bottle has a wide opening.The ergonomically-designed that you will feel lightweight in hand and comfortable to hold. 【Multi-Purpose】Designed to please you from every angle.It is not only a soap dispenser, but also a spray bottle.Ideal for hand sanitizer, liquid soap,lotion, shampoo, body wash,aromatherapy essential oil,etc. 【Personalized Labels】We designed 8 white waterproof printed labels for bottles.4 prints, 4 blanks,you can create your own labels. 【 After-sales Service】We provide you with 3 months of product service. Please feel free to contact us with any questions or concerns.We will resolve your issue within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XuFkPpp1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNNOW","source_asin":"B08B5XJKD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B5XJKD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B5XJKD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":243311,"name":"Yoolax Motorized Roller Shade with Pictures, Blackout Automatic Blinds Works with Alexa Customized Size and Photo, Remote Power Shades with Smart Moto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jgZUXi4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIALS: the electric window shade can be made of blackout fabric or half shading polyester fabric. The blackout fabric can 100% block sunlight, provide UV protection, thermal insulation, and energy-saving. The half shading fabric can let a small amount of light in, brightening the room while still preserving your privacy. CUSTOM PHOTO: the photo of the Alexa blind can be customized by yourself. Just upload or send us your picture and we can print it on the smart blind with environmentally friendly pigments. Design your own custom made blinds and instantly bring rooms to life with your original prints. Photo roller blinds especially can be used as a room divider, which is a modern, stylish way to divide your space into separate, distinct areas. SMART MOTOR: durable quality battery rechargeable motor, each fully charged can work for about 3-5 months. P412 Remote Battery motor needs a hub (Yoolax Hub) to connect to Alexa and Google Assistant. Z425 Smart Motor can directly work with 5 Versions' Alexa. (Echo Plus 2nd Gen, Echo Show 2nd Gen, Echo Studio, Echo Show 10, Echo 4th Gen). Work with Yoolax Solar Panel, no more worry about the charging issue. REMOTE CONTROL: 15 channel remote control (Pair to P412 Remote Battery motor) can control 15 power shades separately and simultaneously. 16 channel remote control(Pair to Z425 Smart Motor) can control 16 motorized shades at most. Mounting hardware & Install instructions included, very easy to install. Procedures are set before delivery, it can be used directly after installation. MADE TO ORDER: the motorized window blinds are custom made, you will see a \"Customize Now\" button on the top right. Custom width is 22\" to 97\" wide, and custom length is 22\" to 118\" long. It is capable of both inside and outside mount. You can choose with Valance or without Valance. We will send an email to you to double confirm the size and photos in 24 hours, please attention to the email the day after your order. And other special needs you can contact us via Amazon message. LEAD TIME: dispatch in 3-5 working days after getting size confirmation. 5-8 working days for transportation. Each remote control blackout blinds are made to order, can't be sold after a return. We appreciate customer precise measures & careful orders, avoid return without quality issues. WARRANTY & SERVICE: Yoolax offers a 2-year warranty on all our motors and remote controls, during which we will repair/replace them free of charge. Please contact us by Amazon message if you have any questions about the product. We will reply within 12 hours and help solve your problem until you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jgZUXi4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoolax","source_asin":"B07VWG4YDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VWG4YDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VWG4YDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
