window.products.push({"id":243423,"name":"5 PCS Plush Shaggy Duvet Cover Sets Full/Queen, Faux Fur Velvet Fluffy Bedding, Luxury Ultra Soft Plush Duvet Covers (1 Fitted Sheet + 1 Plush Duvet C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UwBXjqucL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"[Super Soft 5 pcs Shaggy Duvet Cover Set Queen] 1 piece faux fur duvet cover 90''x90'', 1 crystal flannel bed fitted sheet 60''x80'', 2 pieces faux fur pillow covers 20''x26'', 1 bonus Love shaped throw pillow. There are 32 colors to choose from. The faux fur velvet fluffy bedding is the perfect warm gift for friends, relatives, and loved ones for Valentine's Day, Christmas, Mother's Day, Father's Day, etc. [Available in All Seasons] The luxurious and elegant velvet fluffy bedding duvet cover is made of super soft, high-quality fabric with a lustrous finish. The surface fluff fibers are small and do not shed. It can be used as a blanket in summer with rich texture; in winter, it can be used as a shaggy duvet cover to lock in warmth, velvet duvet cover has a simple, modern, and retro look to add luxury to your bedroom decoration. [Health and Environmental] The luxury shaggy duvet cover set adopts a new generation of green and healthy active printing and dyeing, with high color saturation, no fading, no pilling, and anti-static. The ecological mink velvet is moisture-absorbing and breathable, the velvet is soft and warm, the down is plump and slender, the three-dimensional sense is strong, and the texture is soft. [Reversible Design] The velvet and crystal fleece wraps you in the warmest and most comfortable environment with a layered texture. The sturdy metal hidden zipper design is round and does not hurt the skin, easy to separate and clean, and durable. Humanized design with corner straps, even if you keep moving at night, fluffy bed sets will not shift. [Washing Care] We recommend turning the luxury ultra soft plush duvet covers inside out, machine washing in gentle cold water, and tumble drying on low. Do not bleach/iron. After washing, the velvet hair needs to be combed to restore its previous bulk and smoothness and prolong its life. We recommend cleaning before the first use, which is more skin-friendly (a small amount of product cutting debris is normal for the first wash).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UwBXjqucL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ULIKE","source_asin":"B08N9YJY21","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N9YJY21","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N9YJY21","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
