window.products.push({"id":243464,"name":"GGC Cast Iron Reversible Grill Griddle，Double Sided Grill Pan Perfect for Gas Grills and Stove Tops, 13 x 8.25 Rectangular Baking Flat and Ribbed Grid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617D5XW18MS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dimensions: 13\" L x 8.25\" W for cooking, the total length is 15.5\" (include two side handles). Material: High quality cast iron with matte coating. Package: One reversible grill griddle Reversible Design: One baking pan, both sides can be cooked, the ribbed side is used for grilled foods, such as steaks, lamb chops, fish and chicken; the flat side is used for pan cakes, toast bread, hamburgers, tortillas, fajitas, eggs, bacon, hot dogs, luncheon meat, minced meat, scallops, shrimps, veggies. Versatile and multipurpose grill pan perfect for indoor or outdoor BBQ, you can prepare food for family and friends wherever you go, enjoy different styles of delicious and frying fun Superior Quality: Made of heavy durability cast iron with matte coating to ensure long-lasting use. Easy-grip handles for easier grip with pot holders. better bearing capacity, can hold heavy food. Excellent distribute heat evenly and nicely heat retention, maintain the original flavor of food How to Use: Non-pre-seasoned, please season with vegetable oil (linseed oil) before your first use, let the griddle warm up for a while, then you can cook food you want. Warm Tips: Stay away from metal utensil in cooking How to Clean: In case of paste pot, please do not rush to clean, can add warm water immersion or boil for a few minutes, clean with soft sponge to wipe off excess oil and food residue, do not leave the grill plate in water for longer than 10-15 minutes, please always dry the grill plate immediately with a towel or cloth to evaporate any remaining moisture. Give it a little oil before you store it in a dry and ventilated environment. Warm Tips: Stay away from steel wool in cleaning","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617D5XW18MS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GGC","source_asin":"B0BCFW7MFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCFW7MFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCFW7MFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
