window.products.push({"id":243563,"name":"Personalized Mermaid Reversible Sequin, Custom Sequin Pillow (Rainbow/Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X+QJkUgTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Add a fun decorative touch to any room with this custom reversible mermaid sequin pillowcase! These make great gifts for friends, or just for yourself! Pillowcase is approximately 16\"x16\" reversible sequins with faux suede back.  Text will be printed on white or silver side of sequins, and cropped to fit 13\"x 13\" area on the pillowcase.  PLEASE NOTE: The more letters in your name, the smaller the text will need to be so that your name can fit across the center of the pillow.  Product Care: spot clean only  Package Includes: 1 pillow cover with stuffing added ***FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS*** Why is there white showing around the text/image on my mermaid pillow? Initial printing of the text/image will show the text without a large amount of white in the text. Sequins never go back to the same spot after being moved and swiped, so it's impossible for the text to be completely filled-in after moving the sequins. This can be more easily noticed with photo designs. Why can I see the text/image through the secondary color on my mermaid pillow? Sequins do not lay completely flat so when you are looking at the pillow from below the sequins, you will see the text. Typically this is noticed when you hold the pillow slanted or lay the pillow on a table. Sitting on a couch you will not see as much text/image showing since the eye line is above the sequin. What is your Return Policy? We are a small family business located in Hamilton, OH, so customer satisfaction is important to us! If you have an issue with your product, please contact us so we can assist you or replace your item. We do not accept returns for custom products that are not defective.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X+QJkUgTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VeraFide","source_asin":"B07B4K2RGR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4K2RGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4K2RGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":243564,"name":"Photo Opportunity Poster, Shark Splash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.14,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gn4Vqd1JL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Product Description Shark Party Photo-Op Wall Banner. Plastic. 40\"W X 50\" L. Hang and have each guest walk behind the banner and put their face into the sharks mouth! Include the pictures with your thank you notes! From the Manufacturer I'll just have a bite. Sink your teeth into our Shark Splash collection. Hues of blue create a seafaring backdrop for a shiver of swirling sharks. Fun cupcake toppers add the \"fin-ishing\" touch to this cool party ensemble. With over 80 years of combined experience in the paper and party goods industry, Creative Converting has successfully established itself as a highly respected designer, manufacturer and distributor of disposable tableware, including paper napkins, plates, cups, table covers and plastic cutlery in a variety of solid colors as well as ensemble designs for everyday entertaining, occasions and holidays. A complete offering of décor and accessory items also includes paper lanterns, confetti, cello bags, centerpieces, streamers, candles, gift bags and more. Committed to service, quality, design and innovation, Creative Converting can more than accommodate all your party and event needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gn4Vqd1JL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B0076PEHF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0076PEHF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0076PEHF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":243565,"name":"Forsous Ritz Royale Collection Cotton Terry Pot Holder Hot Pad Set, Butter, 2-Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911kgkLAiQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Established in 1892, the John Ritzenthaler company (Ritz) has long been synonymous with the finest quality in home textiles. This Ritz Royale 2-piece basic pot holder in butter yellow, is a great value set for your kitchen. Made from 100-percent terry looped cotton, the large size pot holder provides great heat protection. Each Ritz pot holder measures 8.5-inch long by 8.25-inch wide. These Ritz pot holders coordinate with the Ritz Royale collection, comprised of aprons, kitchen towels, dishcloths, checked kitchen towels, wonder towels, pot holders, Ritz Mitz, pocket mitts and cotton/neoprene oven mitts. Machine wash in cold water and tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911kgkLAiQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ritz","source_asin":"B0067HFRB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0067HFRB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0067HFRB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
