window.products.push({"id":243763,"name":"Portable Personal Mini Smoothie Blender-USB Rechargeable Shake Smoothies Mixer Single Small Size Fruit Juice Blender Battery Operated Individual Juice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FJQZm1zIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fresh smoothie. Various fruits can be mixed with water, milk and any kind of liquid. Your 24-hour vitamin, dietary fiber, and water supplier.Protein shakes, milkshakes. Add protein powder, water/milk, etc. to provide you with energy and nutrition anytime, anywhere.Breakfast, oatmeal. Add some oats, whole wheat, water/milk, etc. You can enjoy a healthy and energetic breakfast in 5 minutes. Yogurt, fruit sundae, acai bowl... whatever you say!🍨Steps for usage:Step 1：Cut the fruit to 1*1 inch, put it in the cup, and fill it with about 60% of the cup. After adding water/milk to the blender, the amount of water in the cup is about 80%Step 2：Aim the arrow at the switch, double-click to use.Step 3：Tilt the machine at a 45° angle and double-click the on/off button. Step 4：Turn the blender upside down and shake the bottle gently to make it more delicious🍨Use suggestions:‣ When the blender starts to work, it is best not to let the fruit get stuck on the blade, you can first invert the juicer cup, double-click the switch button to start working.‣ When only one indicator light is on, the battery has reached the warning level and should be charged. When all the lights are on, it means it is fully charged.‣ When the juicer is working, it is forbidden to open the lid and put your hands or hard objects into the cup.‣Please make sure that the switch is turned off before cleaning. Do not put the base into the water, otherwise the base components will be damaged.‣ The idle time of the juicer is 5s, and the working time is 40s. Please reset the switch before restarting.‣ The accessories of this mixer cannot be sterilized by microwave or hot water over 80°C.‣ It is forbidden to clean the accessories in washing equipment such as dishwashers.‣ It is forbidden to clean with steel balls or abrasive or corrosive cleaning agents.🍨Specification：‣ Cup Material: BPA Free PCTG food grade‣ Blade Mater","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FJQZm1zIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEFLECTAIR","source_asin":"B09K36F569","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K36F569","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K36F569","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
