window.products.push({"id":243778,"name":"GoodVac Replacement Activated Charcoal Filter Cones Odor Removing Filters Compatible with Filter Queen (6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D4lBVKUsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Filter Queen Activated Charcoal Cone Filters, High Quality aftermarket parts by GoodVac. Activated Charcoal Filter Cones, made to fit Filter Queen Vacuums, choose from 2 filter, 4 filter, 6 filters and 8 filters. Replacement Charcoal Cone Filters replace Filter Queen Part number 4404008100. Activated charcoal removes odors from the air while you vacuum, prevents musty vacuum smell. Recommended to change every 3 to 6 months. Fits all Filter Queen vacuums, fits Majestic, Triple Crown, 75th Anniversary, 360, Princess, 31X, D31X, D33, AN95X","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D4lBVKUsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOODVAC","source_asin":"B074G4HHMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074G4HHMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074G4HHMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":243779,"name":"JoyJolt Triple Insulated Tumbler with Handle. 12 oz Tumbler Cup with Lid. Vacuum Sealed, Copper Lined, Double Wall Stainless Steel Tumblers. Travel Mu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F8WhvMWGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY STOP AT DOUBLE WALL? With the JoyJolt Triple Insulated Coffee Mug, hot drinks stay hot for longer - Our vacuum double wall thermal cup is already brag worthy for its ability to hold heat, but we also infused this reusable cup with copper so you have the hottest drink, even on the coldest day. COFFEE MUG WITH LID! Each thermo insulated cup comes with a Slider Lid. And while the lids are not triple insulated they ARE suction sealed for heat retention and to prevent splashes. Combined with the cup’s insulation, your coffee will stay hot for an extra-long commute in this unspillable cup. TRAVEL MUGS INSULATED FOR HOT AND COLD! The same technology that keeps this temperature control mug hot, also keeps it ice cold and safe to cup in your hands. So you can use it for cold brew coffee, as an iced coffee cup, or a morning smoothie tumbler that you can grip by the handle. UNIVERSAL SIZE FOR ALL DRINKS! This 12oz tumbler cup is 3.5” wide and 4.4” tall. A large tumbler for a short black… or a small tumbler for a Grande! And because they’re triple insulated tumblers with handles you can pour ridiculously steaming hot water your metal cup without burning your hands. CORROSION RESISTANT AND BPA FREE: Your stainless steel coffee mug has an AS lid which is free from BPA and Phthalates. And the 18/8 stainless steel body has been infused with chromium and nickel – both food safe metals that stop our stainless steel cups going rusty! Handwash only to protect vacuum seal. THE CUP OF THE YEAR! This powder coated tumbler comes in many colors including : black, pink, white, and the on-trend Veri Peri Purple - Pantone Color of The Year! Your thermal mug will be safely nestled in a gift box with a 12 Month Guarantee for a satisfying unboxing. So, grab yours now, from JoyJolt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F8WhvMWGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoyJolt","source_asin":"B0BN6ZPY2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN6ZPY2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN6ZPY2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":243780,"name":"Keeptop Adults Weighted Blanket (20 lbs, 48\"x72\", Light Blue) - Cooling Heavy Blanket for Adult Between 190-210 lbs - 100% Natural Cotton Material wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MF5v+KB3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY YOU NEED A WEIGHTED BLANKET - The weighted blanket simulates the feeling of being held or hugged, provides soothing comfort to help for a relaxing and restful night of sleep. The heavy blanket is a perfect gift for your kids, beloved ones, or yourself. HOW TO CHOOSE - The weighted blanket should be 6% to 10% of body weight. The 20 lbs weighted blanket is perfect for adults between 190-210 lbs. PS, the weighted blanket maybe a little smaller than an ordinary blanket to concentrate weight on your body. 100% NATURAL COTTON - This adult weighted blanket is made of soft cotton fabric, which is breathable, cool, and super-comfy. Its breathability can help to regulate body temperature and prevent overheating in the summer. Built for year-round comfort. NO LEAKING BEADS - The weighted blanket for adults is designed with 4\" x 4\" smaller compartments for better weight distribution. Double-stitched edges and two-layer microfiber to prevent the glass beads from leaking out. With 8 internal loops, the weighted blanket will not move around in the duvet cover. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE - Note: it usually takes about 2-7 days for you to get used to the weighted blanket. We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee, a 24-month warranty for quality-related issues. Just feel free to contact Keeptop Customer Service Center directly if you need assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MF5v+KB3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keeptop","source_asin":"B09CKTYYWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CKTYYWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CKTYYWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
