window.products.push({"id":243784,"name":"STAUB Cocotte Oval 33cm Grenadine red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":479.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sryPM4lJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The French oven is a timeless standby for stews, roasts, soups, casseroles and other one-pot classics. Staub has perfected this tradition in our signature \" La Cocotte ” (co-cot) French oven, the choice of some of the world's best chefs. The traditional round design has self-basting spikes for continuous, natural basting. When your meal is ready, La Cocotte moves beautifully from the stove to your table.The Oval Cocottes by Staub have been uniquely designed for stovetop use. By selecting the lowest heat, with sufficient liquid casseroles and pot roasts can be left to their own devices with little attention. Inside the Cocotte you will find the interior has been coated with a highly durable non-stick coating. The base of the Staub Cocotte has been made with a ceramic surface making it suitable to cook on all heat surfaces even in the oven. The lid has been made to snugly fit the Cocotte ensuring that all moisture is retained within the Cocotte. On the underside of the lid you will find several spikes which ensure continuous natural basting and distributes all the flavourful juices for a tender and moist finish to you cuisine.Specifications: • Capacity : 7 Quart• Overall dimensions : 6.4 inches high x 15 inches wide x 11.8 inches deep","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sryPM4lJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STAUB","source_asin":"B0759Y69H5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0759Y69H5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0759Y69H5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":243785,"name":"Navy Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lZBZAq5tL._AC_.jpg","description":"This beautiful Navy ornament will become a cherished keepsake. The hand-stained finish and vibrant background will accentuate any holiday decor. Veterans and active duty personnel alike will appreciate the fine details on this Navy ornament. Each ornament is made and assembled in the USA from Baltic Birch. They are finished using golden oak stain. The ornament is assembled in layers resulting in an eye-catching 3D effect and the brightly colored background accentuates the intricate engraving of the Navy emblem. This ornament is the perfect gift for to honor the Navy member in your life. Whether hanging from the tree, or hanging on a memory wall the rich wood grain finish of this stunning ornament is sure to be a treasured keepsake for many years. Ornaments measure approx. 3.5 inches in diameter. For indoor use only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lZBZAq5tL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orange Kat","source_asin":"B015P0EOOW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015P0EOOW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015P0EOOW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
