window.products.push({"id":243802,"name":"SPRINGRICO Chair Covers for Dining Room Set of 4, Stretch Dining Chair Cover, Washable Spandex Kitchen Parsons Chair Slipcovers, Removable Seat Protec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p2SRB61uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reinvent Your Chairs! Are you ‘over’ the look of your dining chairs? Perhaps the kids spilled one too many things on them, maybe the color and pattern is faded and dull, or you’ve finally had enough of that weird scratchy fabric? You don’t even need a reason! Let’s makeover your chairs together with our premium range of dining room chair covers that are fun and beautiful, as they are soft and comfy. Stretchy Fabric, Suitable For Most Dining Chairs: These universal kitchen chair covers are designed with a top combination of spandex and polyester that means they fit snug without ballooning on regular chairs. It is still important to check our image for measurements, measure your chair and see how perfect they are on your chairs. Its heavy duty elastic band at the bottom keeps chair cover fixed with the chair and does not allow slide or slip-off when you sit on them. It’s As If You Just Refurbished! Plan parties and organize events like never before! Have confidence knowing that your valuable chairs are fully protected. And if you have boring, unattractive chairs or chairs with aged surface- give those dreary chairs a stunning makeover. Instantly transform them from uncomfortable & unsightly into comforting and welcoming chairs where your guests would love to “take a seat”. Easy To Launder and Care! Sticky fingers and pets at home, or customers wiping their fingers on your restaurant chairs (gross), are no match for our dining room seat covers! Just machine wash and line or machine dry. And leave the iron in the cupboard, because they’re wrinkle free! Colors always remain vibrant and the fabric won’t pill or become misshapen, thanks to the durable materials that keep the colors and shape intact, even after multiple washes. How Many Do You Need? Whether you need chair covers for party, chair covers for wedding, restaurant or a small apartment, we have the pack size of 2, 4 or 6, so you can have the exact number of matching slipcovers for chairs that you need. So, let’s get decorating! Love the new look of your chair - or we’ll refund every cent. Your satisfaction is what we strive for 100% of the time, Guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p2SRB61uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPRINGRICO","source_asin":"B08K7PDZ1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K7PDZ1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K7PDZ1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
