window.products.push({"id":243890,"name":"CRYSTALIA Napkin Holder, Elegant Metal Tissue Dispenser for Home Picnic Indoor Outdoor, Decorative Paper Napkin Holder for Kitchen Dining Table & Cock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e4s2pWXpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CRYSTALIA Napkin Holder, Elegant Metal Tissue Dispenser for Home Picnic Indoor Outdoor, Decorative Paper Napkin Holder for Kitchen Dining Table & Cocktail Napkins, Rustic Modern Shaped Design DECORATIVE NAPKIN HOLDER WITH A STURDY MATERIAL: Crystalia decorative napkin holder stand has a modern and elegant design that combines style and function in a single dispenser. It features a shiny classic baroque design. Upright freestanding tissue holder is made of metal Zamac alloy material with a baroque shape design which is rustless, fastness, wear-resistant, stable shape, anti-aging and long service life. MULTIPLE FUNCTIONALITY: It’s not just an item to be used in the kitchen or at home. Whether you want it for outdoor picnics, dining, parties, restaurants. Ideal for holding regular paper napkins. Perfect for use with any napkins. The unique design holds standard size napkins upright, the small size is perfect for decorating your kitchen, adds a touch of rustic charm to your countertop, dining table, or breakfast nook. PERFECT & A LOVELY GIFT: This beautiful, decorative holder complements any home or kitchen décor. Suitable for special occasions including Thanksgiving Day Christmas Parties, New Year, holidays, and the perfect present for neighbors or friends, especially as a housewarming gift. HOME ESSENTIALS NAPKIN HOLDER: The stylish design looks great in any room, adding a fashionable, functional item to your home essentials. Can be hand washed and later dried off with a paper towel. Should NOT be left wet, humid, and sunny environment. Recommend NOT use in the dishwasher. Due to its zamac structure, it can become dull over time. In such cases, you can bring it back to its former shine when you wipe it with the help of cotton.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e4s2pWXpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystalia","source_asin":"B09MJ7M1VL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MJ7M1VL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MJ7M1VL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
