window.products.push({"id":243925,"name":"JOMOLA Bathroom Sink Drain with Overflow Pop up Drain Stopper Vanity Faucet Assembly Vessel Push Button with Strainer Basket Brushed Nickel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5157oUEMtCL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"COMPATIBILITY - Fit standard bathroom vessel sink with 1.6\" to 2.1\" drain hole. Please measure the drain hole of your sink before order. DEEP CLEANING HELP - With strainer basket assembly, which prevent hair or other debris from clogging up the drain. Easily removable for deep cleaning by simply lifting up on the stopper. EXCELLENT SEALING PERFORMANCE - With precision threads and silicone gasket to prevent loosening and leaking. Strong seal. POP-UP STOPPPER - With finger pressing down on the stopper to lock it down OR open it. Match the faucet with no plunger. Install with no tools. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS - Constructed from premium copper, chrome finished, more shiny, corrosion & rust-resistant, NO fading.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5157oUEMtCL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOMOLA","source_asin":"B0BR846V9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR846V9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR846V9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
