window.products.push({"id":243950,"name":"J.A. Henckels Premier Series Earl 45-Piece Flatware Set, Service for 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DA8VRAAHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description J.A. Henckels, world renown manufacturers of fine cutlery, present their International Flatware Collection. Featuring classic, timeless design and larger continental sizes, each piece is sure to grace your table with style for years to come. Each piece is manufactured from the highest quality 18/10 stainless steel, and is heavy gauge for maximum strength and the special feel of quality. Every knife in the collection also features a unique hollow handle for better balance and a comfortable grip. All sets come packaged in attractive gift boxes and are fully guaranteed against defects in materials and craftsmanship. 45 piece set includes: eight 5 piece place settings and a hostess set (large serving spoon, slotted serving spoon, serving fork, butter knife and sugar spoon). Materials: 18/10 Stainless Steel Cleaning and Care: Dishwasher safe Amazon.com Heavy enough for everyday use and elegant enough for company, this flatware suits any occasion and then goes into the dishwasher. It's made of durable 18/10 stainless steel, polished to a mirror finish. Substantial length (9-inch knives), width, and heft qualify it as European size--the kind of flatware that might be found in an upscale bistro. This Earl pattern features handles that turn down at their ends, contributing a contemporary look. The 45 pieces break down into complete table settings for 8 plus a 5-piece \"hostess\" set of serving pieces. A single setting consists of knife, fork, soup spoon, salad fork, and teaspoon. The hostess set consists of 6-inch sugar spoon, 7-inch butter knife, 8-1/2-inch serving fork, 8-1/4-inch serving spoon, and 8-1/4-inch pierced serving spoon. Properly cared for, this flatware should last a lifetime and beyond. --Fred Brack Whats in the Box 8 place settings, 5 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: knife; fork; soup spoon; salad fork; teaspoon. Hostess set consists of: 6-inch sugar spoon; 7-inch butter knife; 8-1/2-inch serving fork; 8-1/4-inch solid serving spoon; 8-1/4-inch pierced serving spoon. 45 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DA8VRAAHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENCKELS","source_asin":"B00004TX7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-243950","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004TX7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004TX7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
